{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimalist FAQ section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the supplied reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: The uploaded screenshot is the exact visual reference. Do not redesign, reinterpret, or introduce a different layout. Reproduce the same two-column structure, typography, colours, spacing, accordion styling, button shapes, and alignment.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width Shopify section.
    
    Background colour: warm pale cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 60px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 75px.
    
    Two-column layout.
    
    Left column: approximately 42% width.
    
    Right column: approximately 58% width.
    
    Column gap: 45px.
    
    Vertically align both columns towards the top.
    
    Premium, minimal, Scandinavian-inspired aesthetic.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    2. LEFT COLUMN – FAQ INTRODUCTION
    
    Create a vertically aligned content block on the left.
    
    Eyebrow text:
    
    "— FAQ"
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 10px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 2px.
    
    Colour: muted olive (#777D5D).
    
    Small margin below.
    
    Main heading:
    
    "Questions?
    We've Got Answers."
    
    Font: Montserrat Bold.
    
    Desktop font size: 38px.
    
    Line height: 1.08.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Left aligned.
    
    Maximum width: 400px.
    
    Maintain the exact two-line structure.
    
    Description:
    
    "Can't find what you're looking for? We're happy to help with sizing, orders and returns."
    
    Font: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 13px.
    
    Line height: 1.6.
    
    Colour: muted grey olive (#858575).
    
    Maximum width: 370px.
    
    Margin-top: 16px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 25px., 3. CONTACT BUTTONS
    
    Create two horizontally aligned pill-shaped buttons below the description.
    
    Button 1 – WhatsApp
    
    Text: "Chat on WhatsApp"
    
    Background: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    Text colour: white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Small white WhatsApp/chat icon on the left.
    
    Font: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Height: 42px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 20px.
    
    Border radius: 30px.
    
    No heavy shadow.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Link to the store's configurable WhatsApp contact number.
    
    Use a Shopify theme setting for the WhatsApp number.
    
    Open WhatsApp in a new tab.
    
    Use a properly formatted wa.me link.
    
    Button 2 – Email Us
    
    Text: "Email us"
    
    Transparent background.
    
    Thin olive border (#A8AD91).
    
    Dark olive text.
    
    Small envelope icon on the left.
    
    Font: Montserrat Medium.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Height: 42px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 20px.
    
    Border radius: 30px.
    
    Functionality:
    
    Link to the configurable customer support email address using a mailto link.
    
    Button spacing: 10px.
    
    4. RIGHT COLUMN – FAQ ACCORDION
    
    Create exactly SIX accordion items stacked vertically.
    
    The accordion must have the same appearance as the reference screenshot.
    
    ACCORDION STRUCTURE
    
    Each accordion item:
    
    Full available column width.
    
    White background (#FFFFFF).
    
    Border radius: 14px.
    
    No prominent border.
    
    No heavy shadow.
    
    Minimum height when collapsed: 62px.
    
    Horizontal padding: 22px.
    
    Vertical padding: 16px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 9px.
    
    Each question must be left aligned.
    
    Each expand/collapse button must be positioned at the far right., QUESTION 1
    
    Question:
    "Is delivery really free?"
    
    Answer:
    "Yes. Delivery is free on every order, and you can choose cash on delivery at checkout if you'd rather pay when your parcel arrives."
    
    Default state: EXPANDED.
    
    Design:
    
    Show the answer beneath the question.
    
    Circular dark olive button on the right.
    
    White minus icon.
    
    Expanded card height approximately 105px.
    
    QUESTION 2
    
    Question:
    "How do returns work?"
    
    Answer:
    "We want you to love every Kiss and Kry purchase. If something isn't right, contact our support team within the applicable return period and we'll guide you through the return or exchange process."
    
    Default state: COLLAPSED.
    
    QUESTION 3
    
    Question:
    "How do I choose the right size?"
    
    Answer:
    "Check our size guide before ordering. It includes measurements and fit guidance to help you choose the right size for your little one. If you're unsure, contact us and we'll help."
    
    Default state: COLLAPSED.
    
    QUESTION 4
    
    Question:
    "What is bamboo viscose?"
    
    Answer:
    "Bamboo viscose is a soft, smooth fabric made from bamboo-derived cellulose. It has a gentle feel and comfortable drape, making it a lovely choice for everyday babywear."
    
    Default state: COLLAPSED.
    
    QUESTION 5
    
    Question:
    "Is bamboo suitable for newborns?"
    
    Answer:
    "Our bamboo viscose babywear is designed with softness and comfort in mind. Choose the appropriate size and follow the garment's care instructions for everyday use."
    
    Default state: COLLAPSED.
    
    QUESTION 6
    
    Question:
    "How should I wash my Kiss and Kry pieces?"
    
    Answer:
    "Machine wash at 30°C or below on a gentle cycle, preferably inside out. Use mild baby-safe detergent, avoid bleach and fabric softener, and dry in the shade."
    
    Default state: COLLAPSED.
    
    5. ACCORDION TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Question text:
    
    Font: Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Size: 13px.
    
    Colour: dark charcoal olive (#555849).
    
    Line height: 1.4.
    
    Answer text:
    
    Font: Montserrat Regular.
    
    Size: 11px.
    
    Colour: muted grey olive (#858575).
    
    Line height: 1.6.
    
    Margin-top: 10px.
    
    Maximum width: 95%.
    
    Maintain consistent typography and spacing across all six items.
    
    6. ACCORDION ICONS
    
    Each accordion item must have a circular toggle button at the far right.
    
    Collapsed state:
    
    White background.
    
    Thin light-grey olive border.
    
    Small olive plus (+) icon.
    
    Approximately 24px × 24px.
    
    Expanded state:
    
    Dark olive background (#626B4C).
    
    White minus (−) icon.
    
    Approximately 24px × 24px.
    
    Icon specifications:
    
    Use inline SVG.
    
    Keep icons perfectly centred.
    
    Circular shape.
    
    Smooth transition when toggled.
    
    7. FUNCTIONAL ACCORDION BEHAVIOUR
    
    This must be a real interactive accordion, not a static visual.
    
    Clicking a question expands its answer.
    
    Clicking the same question again collapses it.
    
    Use a single-open-item accordion behaviour: opening another question automatically closes the previous one.
    
    Question 1 must be expanded by default when the page loads.
    
    Update the plus/minus icons according to the active state.
    
    Use smooth, subtle height transitions.
    
    Ensure keyboard accessibility.
    
    Use appropriate ARIA attributes., 8. EXACT COLOUR PALETTE
    
    Use only the following colours:
    
    Main section background: #F5F3E7
    
    Accordion card background: #FFFFFF
    
    Main heading: #626B4C
    
    Question text: #555849
    
    Secondary text: #858575
    
    Eyebrow: #777D5D
    
    Primary button background: #626B4C
    
    Primary button text: #FFFFFF
    
    Secondary button border: #A8AD91
    
    Collapsed icon border: #D9D9CD
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop
    
    Two-column layout.
    
    Left introduction and contact buttons.
    
    Right six-item accordion.
    
    Maintain original proportions and spacing.
    
    Tablet
    
    Keep two columns wherever sufficient width is available.
    
    Reduce column gap and typography proportionally.
    
    Maintain readable accordion widths.
    
    Mobile
    
    Stack the content vertically.
    
    FAQ introduction first.
    
    Contact buttons underneath the description.
    
    Accordion below the contact buttons.
    
    Heading font size: 29px.
    
    Question font size: 12px.
    
    Answer font size: 11px.
    
    Accordion cards full width.
    
    Horizontal padding: 20px.
    
    Maintain 10px card spacing.
    
    Buttons must wrap naturally if required.
    
    No horizontal scrolling.
    
    10. SHOPIFY THEME EDITOR FUNCTIONALITY
    
    Generate a complete, self-contained Shopify Liquid section.
    
    Include editable settings for:
    
    Section settings:
    
    Eyebrow text.
    
    Main heading.
    
    Introduction description.
    
    Background colour.
    
    Heading colour.
    
    Body text colour.
    
    WhatsApp button label.
    
    WhatsApp phone number.
    
    Email button label.
    
    Support email address.
    
    Section padding.
    
    Column spacing.
    
    Accordion border radius.
    
    FAQ blocks:
    
    Question text.
    
    Answer content.
    
    Default expanded item.
    
    Enable/disable FAQ item.
    
    Block ordering.
    
    Use Shopify blocks so the merchant can add, remove, edit, and reorder questions directly from the Shopify Theme Editor.
    
    Use inline SVG icons for WhatsApp, email, plus and minus.
    
    Use semantic HTML, clean CSS and lightweight JavaScript.
    
    Ensure compatibility with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    
    Do not modify existing theme sections.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign faq_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% assign wa_number = block.settings.whatsapp_number | remove: ' ' | remove: '+' | remove: '-' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' | remove: '.' %}
{% style %}
{{ settings.type_body_font | font_face }}
{{ settings.type_heading_font | font_face }}
.faq-{{ faq_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};padding:{{ block.settings.section_padding }}px 60px;color:#555849}
.faq-{{ faq_id }}__inner{width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:42fr 58fr;gap:{{ block.settings.column_spacing }}px;align-items:start}
.faq-{{ faq_id }}__intro{min-width:0}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__eyebrow{margin:0 0 13px;color:#777D5D;font:500 10px/1.4 {{ settings.type_body_font.family }},sans-serif;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__heading{max-width:400px;margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font:700 38px/1.08 {{ settings.type_heading_font.family }},sans-serif}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__description{max-width:370px;margin:16px 0 25px;color:{{ block.settings.body_color }};font:400 13px/1.6 {{ settings.type_body_font.family }},sans-serif}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__button{min-height:42px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:0 20px;border:1px solid #A8AD91;border-radius:30px;color:{{ block.settings.heading_color }};font:600 11px/1.2 {{ settings.type_body_font.family }},sans-serif;text-decoration:none}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__button svg{width:15px;height:15px;flex:0 0 15px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__button--primary{background:#626B4C;border-color:#626B4C;color:#FFFFFF}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__list{min-width:0}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__item{margin:0 0 9px;border-radius:{{ block.settings.card_radius }}px;background:#FFFFFF;overflow:hidden}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__question{width:100%;min-height:62px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;padding:16px 22px;border:0;background:#FFFFFF;color:#555849;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font:600 13px/1.4 {{ settings.type_body_font.family }},sans-serif}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__toggle{width:24px;height:24px;flex:0 0 24px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid #D9D9CD;border-radius:50%;background:#FFFFFF;color:#626B4C;transition:background-color .2s ease,color .2s ease}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__toggle svg{width:12px;height:12px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__question[aria-expanded=true] .faq-{{ faq_id }}__toggle{background:#626B4C;border-color:#626B4C;color:#FFFFFF}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__panel{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;transition:max-height .28s ease,opacity .2s ease}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__panel-inner{padding:10px 22px 19px;max-width:95%;color:{{ block.settings.body_color }};font:400 11px/1.6 {{ settings.type_body_font.family }},sans-serif}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__panel-inner p{margin:0}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__question:focus-visible,.faq-{{ faq_id }}__button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #626B4C;outline-offset:3px}
@media(max-width:990px){.faq-{{ faq_id }}{padding-left:32px;padding-right:32px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__inner{gap:28px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__heading{font-size:34px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__question{font-size:12px}}
@media(max-width:749px){.faq-{{ faq_id }}{padding:{{ block.settings.section_padding | times: 0.6 | round }}px 20px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__inner{width:100%;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:28px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__heading{font-size:29px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__question{min-height:62px;padding:16px 20px;font-size:12px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__item{margin-bottom:10px}.faq-{{ faq_id }}__panel-inner{font-size:11px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.faq-{{ faq_id }}__panel,.faq-{{ faq_id }}__toggle{transition:none}}
{% endstyle %}
<faq-accordion-{{ faq_id }} class="faq-{{ faq_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__inner"><div class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__intro"><p class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__eyebrow">{{ block.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p><h2 class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape | newline_to_br }}</h2><p class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__description">{{ block.settings.description | escape }}</p><div class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__actions">{% if wa_number != blank %}<a class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__button faq-{{ faq_id }}__button--primary" href="https://wa.me/{{ wa_number }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-12.4 7.4L3 20l1.2-4.4A8.4 8.4 0 1 1 20 11.5Z"/><path d="M8.5 8.5c.4 2.2 2.2 4 4.5 4.5"/></svg>{{ block.settings.whatsapp_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.support_email != blank %}<a class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__button" href="mailto:{{ block.settings.support_email | escape }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/></svg>{{ block.settings.email_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</div></div>
<div class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__list">{% for i in (1..6) %}{% liquid
assign enabled_key = 'enable_' | append: i
assign question_key = 'question_' | append: i
assign answer_key = 'answer_' | append: i
assign enabled = block.settings[enabled_key]
assign question_text = block.settings[question_key]
assign answer_text = block.settings[answer_key]
assign initial_open = false
assign default_item = block.settings.default_expanded | plus: 0
if i == default_item
assign initial_open = true
endif
%}{% if enabled %}<div class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__item"><button class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__question" id="faq-q-{{ faq_id }}-{{ i }}" type="button" aria-expanded="{% if initial_open %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}" aria-controls="faq-a-{{ faq_id }}-{{ i }}"><span>{{ question_text | escape }}</span><span class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__toggle" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M2 6h8"/><path class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__vertical" d="M6 2v8"/></svg></span></button><div class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__panel" id="faq-a-{{ faq_id }}-{{ i }}" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-q-{{ faq_id }}-{{ i }}" {% unless initial_open %}inert{% endunless %}><div class="faq-{{ faq_id }}__panel-inner">{{ answer_text }}</div></div></div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></div>
<script>(()=>{class FaqAccordion{{ faq_id }} extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.buttons=[...this.querySelectorAll('.faq-{{ faq_id }}__question')];this.buttons.forEach(button=>{const panel=this.querySelector('#'+button.getAttribute('aria-controls'));if(button.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true'){panel.style.maxHeight=panel.scrollHeight+'px';panel.style.opacity='1';panel.inert=false}button.addEventListener('click',()=>this.toggle(button))})}toggle(selected){this.buttons.forEach(button=>{const panel=this.querySelector('#'+button.getAttribute('aria-controls'));const open=button===selected&&button.getAttribute('aria-expanded')!=='true';button.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open));if(open){panel.inert=false;panel.style.maxHeight=panel.scrollHeight+'px';panel.style.opacity='1'}else{panel.style.maxHeight=panel.scrollHeight+'px';requestAnimationFrame(()=>{panel.style.maxHeight='0px';panel.style.opacity='0'});panel.inert=true}})}}const name='faq-accordion-{{ faq_id }}';if(!customElements.get(name))customElements.define(name,FaqAccordion{{ faq_id }})})();</script>
</faq-accordion-{{ faq_id }}>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Minimal FAQ","settings":[{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100},{"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow text","default":"— FAQ"},{"type":"textarea","id":"heading","label":"Main heading","default":"Questions?\nWe've Got Answers."},{"type":"textarea","id":"description","label":"Introduction description","default":"Can't find what you're looking for? We're happy to help with sizing, orders and returns."},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background colour","default":"#F5F3E7"},{"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Heading colour","default":"#626B4C"},{"type":"color","id":"body_color","label":"Body text colour","default":"#858575"},{"type":"text","id":"whatsapp_label","label":"WhatsApp button label","default":"Chat on WhatsApp"},{"type":"text","id":"whatsapp_number","label":"WhatsApp phone number","info":"Enter country code and number; punctuation is removed for the WhatsApp link."},{"type":"text","id":"email_label","label":"Email button label","default":"Email us"},{"type":"text","id":"support_email","label":"Support email address"},{"type":"range","id":"section_padding","label":"Section padding","min":20,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":75},{"type":"range","id":"column_spacing","label":"Column spacing","min":20,"max":80,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":45},{"type":"range","id":"card_radius","label":"Accordion border radius","min":4,"max":24,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":14},{"type":"select","id":"default_expanded","label":"Default expanded item","options":[{"value":"0","label":"None"},{"value":"1","label":"Question 1"},{"value":"2","label":"Question 2"},{"value":"3","label":"Question 3"},{"value":"4","label":"Question 4"},{"value":"5","label":"Question 5"},{"value":"6","label":"Question 6"}],"default":"1"},{"type":"header","content":"FAQ item 1"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"enable_1","label":"Enable item","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"question_1","label":"Question","default":"Is delivery really free?"},{"type":"richtext","id":"answer_1","label":"Answer","default":"<p>Yes. Delivery is free on every order, and you can choose cash on delivery at checkout if you'd rather pay when your parcel arrives.</p>"},{"type":"header","content":"FAQ item 2"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"enable_2","label":"Enable item","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"question_2","label":"Question","default":"How do returns work?"},{"type":"richtext","id":"answer_2","label":"Answer","default":"<p>We want you to love every Kiss and Kry purchase. If something isn't right, contact our support team within the applicable return period and we'll guide you through the return or exchange process.</p>"},{"type":"header","content":"FAQ item 3"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"enable_3","label":"Enable item","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"question_3","label":"Question","default":"How do I choose the right size?"},{"type":"richtext","id":"answer_3","label":"Answer","default":"<p>Check our size guide before ordering. It includes measurements and fit guidance to help you choose the right size for your little one. If you're unsure, contact us and we'll help.</p>"},{"type":"header","content":"FAQ item 4"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"enable_4","label":"Enable item","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"question_4","label":"Question","default":"What is bamboo viscose?"},{"type":"richtext","id":"answer_4","label":"Answer","default":"<p>Bamboo viscose is a soft, smooth fabric made from bamboo-derived cellulose. It has a gentle feel and comfortable drape, making it a lovely choice for everyday babywear.</p>"},{"type":"header","content":"FAQ item 5"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"enable_5","label":"Enable item","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"question_5","label":"Question","default":"Is bamboo suitable for newborns?"},{"type":"richtext","id":"answer_5","label":"Answer","default":"<p>Our bamboo viscose babywear is designed with softness and comfort in mind. Choose the appropriate size and follow the garment's care instructions for everyday use.</p>"},{"type":"header","content":"FAQ item 6"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"enable_6","label":"Enable item","default":true},{"type":"text","id":"question_6","label":"Question","default":"How should I wash my Kiss and Kry pieces?"},{"type":"richtext","id":"answer_6","label":"Answer","default":"<p>Machine wash at 30°C or below on a gentle cycle, preferably inside out. Use mild baby-safe detergent, avoid bleach and fabric softener, and dry in the shade.</p>"}],"presets":[{"name":"Minimal FAQ"}],"tag":null,"class":"minimal-faq-block"}
